ese data are possible for $AX=B$. If possible, describe the solution set. Explain.\n\nWritten response: {{response}}" :question/worked-solution "Possible; a unique solution. Equal ranks imply consistency, and both variable columns are pivot columns, so there are no free variables."}] [[:step/id #uuid "0f352ecc-b2d6-5146-b9c0-6312ed1fe612"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484432 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484469} :step/id #uuid "0f352ecc-b2d6-5146-b9c0-6312ed1fe612" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484423}}] [[:step/id #uuid "04726b4c-51f5-5ade-9a15-fc8a2d1bc723"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484423 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484598} :step/id #uuid "04726b4c-51f5-5ade-9a15-fc8a2d1bc723" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484523}}] [[:step/id #uuid "81e80c16-96d2-50f5-a080-7f8b54baf26f"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484523 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484571} :step/id #uuid "81e80c16-96d2-50f5-a080-7f8b54baf26f" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484547}}] [[:step/id #uuid "9644e7c3-d817-53ec-a40e-6ee67c359e43"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484547 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484541} :step/id #uuid "9644e7c3-d817-53ec-a40e-6ee67c359e43" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484595}}] [[:step/id #uuid "dc9a9ddb-a1d0-59b8-b2d9-d1c3b69d715f"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484595 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484461} :step/id #uuid "dc9a9ddb-a1d0-59b8-b2d9-d1c3b69d715f"}] [[:multistep/id #uuid "00b745be-55d6-5d6e-bea7-83fb8b9454c2"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484419 :multistep/context "Source question: Exercise **1.2.58**, [printed page 49 (PDF page 61)](/api/source?path=%2Fhome%2Fjake%2FDeveloper%2Fstudy%2Fvault%2FF26%2Fsource%2F341%2FKuttler-LinearAlgebra-AFirstCourse-2017A.pdf#page=61)." :multistep/first-step {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484432} :multistep/id #uuid "00b745be-55d6-5d6e-bea7-83fb8b9454c2" :multistep/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484423} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484432} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186484523} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186